# CatDex — Accessibility

## Musts

- Icon-only controls: `accessibilityRole="button"` + French `accessibilityLabel`
- Progress (onboarding dots, signup steps, analysis): expose `accessibilityRole="progressbar"` + values when present
- Modals: `accessibilityViewIsModal` (see `MapCatModal`)
- Don’t rely on color alone for rarity / password strength — include text labels
- Respect reduced motion (`useReducedMotion`)

## Contrast

- Prefer theme text tokens on surfaces (`text`, `textBody`, `textSecondary` on white / canvas)
- Brand text on soft indigo is OK; white text only on `brand` / danger fills (`onBrand`)

## Touch

- Min ~40–48 pt targets for map tools and FABs (spacing tokens `40` / `48`)
- Avoid nesting conflicting pressables

## Copy

- Error and empty states must be readable by VoiceOver/TalkBack (text nodes, not only icons)
